      <!-- The speaker and gauge are a button: a tap opens the mini player
           (PlayerControls), which has the volume slider and mute. Drawn
           under them, flat until pointed at, then pressed in like the tray.
           Its hit rect reaches down to the window frame (y 30), so a finger
           at the top edge of the screen finds it. Nothing navigates here;
           Down leaves for the task bar. Not on the login screen. -->
